          "id": 1254566295,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "This means that the related packet indicators on the left edge of the packet list don't work for conv_elements, since it's NULL when PacketList::selectionChanged redissects the packet. It looks like it works for protocols that use addresses+ports because find_conversation_pinfo defaults to matching based on pinfo->src, pinfo->dst, etc. directly.",
